&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;section id="about" class="section rad-animation-group pb-0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="rad-fade-down"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="row d-flex flex-column-reverse flex-md-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="about__profile-picture col-12 col-md-6"&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10;&#10; &lt;picture class=""&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &lt;source srcset="https://rafaeldutra.me/images/avatar_hu_18154a3c44be38e5.webp 1x, https://rafaeldutra.me/images/avatar_hu_8e618300b1edda52.webp 2x" type="image/webp" /&gt;&#10; &lt;source srcset="https://rafaeldutra.me/images/avatar_hu_fd4cd9216efc7ddd.png 1x, https://rafaeldutra.me/images/avatar_hu_dc00af0b16d4c750.png 2x" type="image/png"&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;img&#10; width="256"&#10; height="256"&#10; class="lozad img-responsive image-left-overflow"&#10; data-src="https://rafaeldutra.me/images/avatar_hu_fd4cd9216efc7ddd.png"&#10; alt=''&#10; src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhBwACAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAAHAAIAAAIDjI9YADs="&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; /&gt;&#10; &lt;/picture&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="col-12 col-md-6 my-auto"&gt;&#10; &lt;h2&gt;Quem sou eu&lt;/h2&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="about-me content"&gt;&#10; Mais de 14 anos de experiência em tecnologia da informação, administração de redes e análise de infraestrutura, principalmente em ambientes &lt;strong&gt;GNU/Linux&lt;/strong&gt;. Desde 2015 atuo com automação de infraestrutura (&lt;em&gt;Infrastructure as Code&lt;/em&gt;) usando diversas ferramentas para diferentes cenários — de provisionamento imutável a pipelines de operação de plataforma.&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;a href="https://rafaeldutra.me/skills" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary mt-3"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="icon-user"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; Ver skills&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;section&#10; id="education"&#10; class="section section--border-bottom rad-animation-group"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="container-education"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="row rad-fade-down"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="col-12"&gt;&#10; &lt;h2&gt;Formação&lt;/h2&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="row pt-2 pt-md-4"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="col-12 col-sm-6 mb-4 mb-sm-0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__date"&gt;2017&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__title"&gt;UNISINOS — São Leopoldo/RS&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__degree"&gt;Segurança da Tecnologia da Informação (não concluído)&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="col-12 col-sm-6 mb-4 mb-sm-0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__date"&gt;2010–2011&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__title"&gt;Centro de Tecnologia em Automação e Informática — SENAI/SC, Florianópolis/SC&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__degree"&gt;Redes de Computadores (não concluído)&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="col-12 col-sm-6 mb-4 mb-sm-0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__date"&gt;2008–2009&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__title"&gt;UNISINOS — São Leopoldo/RS&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__degree"&gt;Segurança da Tecnologia da Informação (não concluído)&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="col-12 col-sm-6 mb-4 mb-sm-0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__date"&gt;2004–2007&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__title"&gt;Escola Estadual de Educação Profissional em Estrela — Estrela/RS&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="education__degree"&gt;Técnico em Redes de Computadores (concluído)&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;section id="experience-single" class="section-experience section section--border-bottom rad-animation-group flex-grow-1"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="row flex-column-reverse flex-md-row rad-fade-down"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience-list col-12 col-md-6"&gt;&#10; &lt;h2&gt;&#10; &#10; Experiência&#10; &#10; &lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://rafaeldutra.me/experience/job-01-4all/" class="experience__link"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__header"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience__meta"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__date"&gt;Fev 2022 – Atual&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__title"&gt;DevOps / SRE Engineer&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__company"&gt;&#10; 4ALL.&#10; &lt;span class="experience__location"&gt;Porto Alegre/RS, Brasil&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__description d-none d-print-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1&gt;DevOps / SRE Engineer — 4ALL&lt;/h1&gt;&#10; Empresa de tecnologia.&#10;Infraestrutura como código: diversos projetos em Terraform para ambientes AWS. Implementação e administração de clusters Kubernetes (EKS) em diferentes contas AWS, com múltiplos componentes. Automações de operação de plataforma em nível de pipeline, desenvolvidas em Shell Script e Python. Observabilidade de sistemas e infraestrutura com Prometheus, Grafana e CloudWatch — latência, erros 4xx/5xx, uso de memória, volume de requisições. Docker e Docker Compose para ambientes de desenvolvimento de infraestrutura; ferramenta interna em Shell Script disponibilizada como open source (cid). CI/CD com Git/GitLab. Ciclo completo de automação de infraestrutura com Packer, Terraform e Ansible para AWS usando GitLab. &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://rafaeldutra.me/experience/job-02-poatek/" class="experience__link"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__header"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience__meta"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__date"&gt;Jan 2020 – Jan 2021&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__title"&gt;DevOps Engineer&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__company"&gt;&#10; PoaTek IT Consulting.&#10; &lt;span class="experience__location"&gt;Porto Alegre/RS, Brasil&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__description d-none d-print-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1&gt;DevOps Engineer — PoaTek&lt;/h1&gt;&#10; Empresa de tecnologia.&#10;CI/CD com AWS CodeCommit e CodePipeline. Infraestrutura como código com CloudFormation. Scripts em Python com Boto3 para AWS. &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://rafaeldutra.me/experience/job-03-sicredi/" class="experience__link"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__header"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience__meta"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__date"&gt;Mai 2019 – Jan 2020&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__title"&gt;DevOps Engineer&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__company"&gt;&#10; Sicredi.&#10; &lt;span class="experience__location"&gt;Porto Alegre/RS, Brasil&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__description d-none d-print-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1&gt;DevOps Engineer — Sicredi&lt;/h1&gt;&#10; Alocado para o Sicredi.&#10;Ciclo completo de automação de infraestrutura com Packer, Terraform e Ansible para AWS usando GitLab. CI/CD com Git/GitLab. Ambientes Blue/Green na AWS. Roles Ansible para automação de cluster multi-master de Kubernetes. HashiCorp Consul e Vault; coleta de métricas com Spring Boot para o Consul. TDD para roles Ansible. Scripts em Python com Boto3 para AWS. &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://rafaeldutra.me/experience/job-04-stefanini/" class="experience__link"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__header"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience__meta"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__date"&gt;Ago 2018 – Mai 2019&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__title"&gt;DevOps Engineer&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__company"&gt;&#10; Stefanini | IT Solutions and IT Staffing.&#10; &lt;span class="experience__location"&gt;Porto Alegre/RS, Brasil&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__description d-none d-print-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1&gt;DevOps Engineer — Stefanini&lt;/h1&gt;&#10; Automação de infraestrutura com Docker, Docker Compose, Bash, Terraform, Ansible, Puppet e Cloud-init. AWS: EC2, EBS, RDS. Documentação de ferramentas internas usadas na AWS. Integração contínua com Git e GitLab. Publicação de módulos Terraform para gerenciar registros e zonas do AWS Route 53. &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://rafaeldutra.me/experience/job-05-jive/" class="experience__link"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__header"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience__meta"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__date"&gt;Jan 2018 – Jul 2018&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__title"&gt;SaaS Architect&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__company"&gt;&#10; Jive Software (via Crossover).&#10; &lt;span class="experience__location"&gt;Portland, Oregon, EUA (remoto)&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__description d-none d-print-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1&gt;SaaS Architect — Jive Software&lt;/h1&gt;&#10; Jive Software é parte da Aurea Company. Trabalho remoto pela Crossover.&#10;Automação de infraestrutura com Docker, Docker Compose, Bash e Puppet. Suporte a ferramentas internas. AWS: EC2, EBS. Documentação de ferramentas, processos e procedimentos. Agendador de tarefas (Rundeck). Integração contínua com Git, Bitbucket e Jenkins. Monitoramento de logs e métricas (Datadog e Flapjack). &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://rafaeldutra.me/experience/job-06-poatek-agco/" class="experience__link"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__header"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience__meta"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__date"&gt;Out 2016 – Jan 2018&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__title"&gt;DevOps Engineer&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__company"&gt;&#10; PoaTek IT Consulting.&#10; &lt;span class="experience__location"&gt;Porto Alegre/RS, Brasil&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__description d-none d-print-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1&gt;DevOps Engineer — PoaTek (AGCO)&lt;/h1&gt;&#10; Alocado para a AGCO (Agriculture Corporation).&#10;Deploy e automação de infraestrutura com Docker, Docker Compose, Bash e Puppet. Integração contínua com Git, Bitbucket e Bamboo. Logs e métricas com Elasticsearch, Logstash, Grafana, Telegraf e InfluxDB. Automação de ambientes de desenvolvimento com VirtualBox, Vagrant, Packer, Linux e Preseed. Agendador de jobs (Rundeck) e ferramentas de build (Gradle, Apache Maven). Administração de servidores Linux (Ubuntu Server) e documentação de processos para desenvolvedores. Participação em projetos especiais de implementação de novas ferramentas. &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience-description col-12 col-md-6"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="container-experience"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="row"&gt;&#10; &lt;h2&gt;Trajetória&lt;/h2&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="lead"&gt;Atuação como DevOps / SRE em consultorias e produtos, com foco em AWS, Kubernetes, Terraform e automação de pipelines.&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="row"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="col-12 col-lg-4"&gt;&#10; &lt;a&#10; href='https://www.linkedin.com/in/rafaeldutra'&#10; class="btn btn-primary btn-block w-100"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener noreferrer"&#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;i class="icon-linkedin"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; LinkedIn&#10; &lt;i class="icon-arrow-right"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="col-12 col-lg-4"&gt;&#10; &lt;a&#10; href='https://rafaeldutra.me/cv'&#10; class="btn btn-frameless w-100"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener noreferrer"&#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;i class="icon-user"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; Currículo completo&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="col-12 col-lg-4"&gt;&#10; &lt;a&#10; href='https://rafaeldutra.me/experience'&#10; class="btn btn-frameless w-100"&#10; rel="noopener noreferrer"&#10; &gt;&#10; &#10; Ver tudo&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;section id="experience-list-shortcode" class="section-experience section section--border-bottom rad-animation-group flex-grow-1 "&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="row flex-column-reverse flex-md-row rad-fade-down"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience-list col-12 mt-5 mt-sm-0"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;h2 class="section__title mb-4"&gt;Experiência (lista)&lt;/h2&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience row"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__header col-12 col-md-3 d-flex align-items-start"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;div class="experience__meta"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__date"&gt;Fev 2022 – Atual&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__title"&gt;DevOps / SRE Engineer&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="experience__company"&gt;